# Through VPN1. One entry per line: IPv4, subnet, range, domain or AS number.
# Optional tag before the entry - what to do when VPN1 is down:
#   (none)  fall back to the provider
#   !KS0    block
#   !KS2    VPN2, then block
#   !FB2    VPN2, then the provider
#
# Examples:
# 2ip.ru
# !KS0 AS555842
# !KS2 203.0.113.0/24
